This directory contains selected public documentation from the following Apache-2.0 repositories:

- Autoware Universe: https://github.com/autowarefoundation/autoware_universe
- Autoware Documentation: https://github.com/autowarefoundation/autoware-documentation
- Autoware Documentation Chinese community translation: https://github.com/tomato-ros/autoware-documentation-cn

Each source snapshot is pinned by commit in corpus_manifest.json. The Chinese repository is a community-maintained translation and is not an official Autoware translation. The local Markdown files generated from its HTML pages are derived, indexable representations; upstream HTML hashes are retained in the manifest.

This project is an independent demonstration and is not affiliated with the Autoware Foundation or the listed repositories.
